    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/gpvhza-cz/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=592090514438750980&sectionId=592090514505859844)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvaUBZF1D__text","label":"ggvaUBZF1D__text","default":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\">5 Reasons Why REGROW™ Reactivates Hair Growth Naturally — Without the Usual Struggle</span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggageb314dy_text","label":"ggageb314dy_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:18px;\">Tired of trying endless products that promise results but never deliver? Discover how <strong>REGROW™</strong> revitalizes your scalp from the inside out — for visibly thicker, stronger hair in record time, without complicated treatments.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3RGcdsqN__text","label":"gg3RGcdsqN__text","default":"<span style=\"font-size:24px;\">1. APPLICATION INDOLORE EN UNE MINUTE</span>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7ajWu5HYP_text","label":"gg7ajWu5HYP_text","default":"<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Pas d'étapes compliquées, pas de longues routines. Tamponnez-le délicatement sur les zones clairsemées (on dirait que vous tapotez avec votre ongle), et c'est terminé en moins de 60 secondes. Constatez des améliorations visibles en seulement une semaine, avec une croissance remarquable en 8 à 10 semaines.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9jYiee2Ux_text","label":"gg9jYiee2Ux_text","default":"1. PASSEZ DE LA PERTE DE CHEVEUX À UNE CHEVELURE COMPLÈTE INSTANTANÉMENT"},{"type":"html","id":"ggigksYMOGT_text","label":"ggigksYMOGT_text","default":"<p><strong>REGROW™</strong> works directly where hair loss begins, by reducing excess DHT and stimulating dormant follicles.</p><p><br>Our precision micro-needles create ultra-fine openings in the scalp, allowing the active serum to penetrate deeply, halt shedding in just one week, and trigger <strong>new growth within 8–10 weeks.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggw0EF81rp6_text","label":"ggw0EF81rp6_text","default":"1. FROM THINNING HAIR TO DENSITY — FAST"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnvT7KBOpQ_text","label":"ggnvT7KBOpQ_text","default":"1. GO FROM HAIR LOSS TO A FULL HEAD OF HAIR — INSTANTLY"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjkv5m1vuM_text","label":"ggjkv5m1vuM_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:16px;\"><strong>ReGrow™ targets the root cause of hair loss: excess DHT.</strong></span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:16px;\">The micro-needles create tiny openings in your scalp, ensuring the active formula penetrates deeply to stop hair loss within 1 week and trigger rapid regrowth in 8 to 10 weeks.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpiz-sEMZs_text","label":"ggpiz-sEMZs_text","default":"1. PASSEZ DE LA PERTE DE CHEVEUX À UNE CHEVELURE COMPLÈTE INSTANTANÉMENT"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUVMhu0dq0_text","label":"ggUVMhu0dq0_text","default":"2. EFFORTLESS, PAINLESS, AND FAST"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBuXqnlX5v_text","label":"ggBuXqnlX5v_text","default":"2. PAIN-FREE APPLICATION<br>IN JUST ONE MINUTE"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAfEwZaHfX_text","label":"ggAfEwZaHfX_text","default":"<span style=\"font-size:24px;\">2. APPLICATION INDOLORE EN UNE MINUTE</span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjCATAKblz_text","label":"ggjCATAKblz_text","default":"<p><span style=\"font-size:17px;\">Forget endless steps or greasy products.</span><br><span style=\"font-size:17px;\">Simply apply the serum to thinning areas using the micro-infusion tool, it feels like a soft tap on the scalp. The entire process takes less than a minute, yet delivers visible improvement within the first week.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtYc7Qs-ws_text","label":"ggtYc7Qs-ws_text","default":"<strong>3. APPROVED AND RECOMMENDED BY TRICHOLOGISTS</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQcV0SPRl3_text","label":"ggQcV0SPRl3_text","default":"<span style=\"font-size:24px;\">3. APPLICATION INDOLORE EN UNE MINUTE</span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggx9SeSwdGe_text","label":"ggx9SeSwdGe_text","default":"<p><span style=\"font-size:17px;\">Developed with leading trichologists, <strong>REGROW™</strong> combines powerful botanical actives like <strong>Panax Ginseng</strong> and <strong>Eclipta Prostrata</strong>, known for their ability to reactivate natural hair growth safely and effectively.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDUaJgKbVe_text","label":"ggDUaJgKbVe_text","default":"<strong>3. CLINICALLY VALIDATED &amp; DERMATOLOGIST APPROVED</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqeDBNjmZ7_text","label":"ggqeDBNjmZ7_text","default":"<strong>4. 90-DAY MONEY-BACK PROMISE</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYDJqukkP8_text","label":"ggYDJqukkP8_text","default":"<strong>4. </strong>90-DAY HAIR GROWTH&nbsp;<br>GUARANTEE – RISK-FREE"},{"type":"html","id":"gg_jSn-ii-R_text","label":"gg_jSn-ii-R_text","default":"<span style=\"font-size:24px;\">4. GARANTIE DE CROISSANCE DE 120 JOURS - ZÉRO RISQUE</span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDgUGQ3BgZ_text","label":"ggDgUGQ3BgZ_text","default":"<p><span style=\"font-size:17px;\"><strong>We stand behind our results.</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:17px;\">If your hair doesn’t appear thicker and fuller after consistent use, return it <strong>within 90 days</strong>, and get a full refund, no questions asked.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gggsNSdZ6Nf_text","label":"gggsNSdZ6Nf_text","default":"<strong>5. JOIN THE LEGION OF CONFIDENT MEN</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZb395-ucR_text","label":"ggZb395-ucR_text","default":"<span style=\"font-size:24px;\">5. REJOIGNEZ LA LÉGION DES HOMMES CONFIANTS</span>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3iH55L4Vr_text","label":"gg3iH55L4Vr_text","default":"<p>Thousands of users have already transformed their hair, and their self-confidence.<br>With <strong>REGROW™</strong>, you’ll finally experience a stronger, denser look that speaks for itself.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLxhXdAkRm_text","label":"ggLxhXdAkRm_text","default":"<strong>5. CONFIDENCE STARTS WITH HEALTHY HAIR</strong>"}],
